<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">再斟满一杯 毕竟</text><text for="L2">隐约觉得你心怀异样</text><text for="L3">去他的 准没安好心</text><text for="L4">荒唐至极</text><text for="L5">尝尝我这颗酸楚苦涩的心</text><text for="L6">我知道这会让你面颊微红</text><text for="L7">然而</text><text for="L8">这一切早已变了味道</text><text for="L9">我一直在侧耳细听 处处留心 你却充耳不闻</text><text for="L10">你将所有心思随意抛洒</text><text for="L11">全耗在外面的谎言里</text><text for="L12">噢 噢</text><text for="L13">耶 耶</text><text for="L14">你如同侵蚀神经的麻醉剂</text><text for="L15">让人浑然不觉痛楚</text><text for="L16">是啊</text><text for="L17">耶</text><text for="L18">脑海中剧毒蔓延</text><text for="L19">将意识彻底麻痹</text><text for="L20">嘿</text><text for="L21">嘿 嘿 耶</text><text for="L22">你像这无解的麻药</text><text for="L23">一点点封住知觉</text><text for="L24">为你饮鸩止渴 沉溺成疾</text><text for="L25">令我恍若置身一部电影</text><text for="L26">过来吧 让我们拍一场电影</text><text for="L27">任由躯体起伏缠绵</text><text for="L28">深陷 坠落 沉沦</text><text for="L29">愈陷愈深</text><text for="L30">不可自拔</text><text for="L31">哦 啊</text><text for="L32">翻看着与你的每一帧合照 尽是追忆</text><text for="L33">我是那样想你 可你身处其中并不快乐</text><text for="L34">曾与你在城中消磨时光</text><text for="L35">城中忙碌 你却并非为这份奇妙而来</text><text for="L36">我本不想就此坠入情网</text><text for="L37">却只能身不由己按部就班</text><text for="L38">那就来吧 宝贝 好歹给我点回应</text><text for="L39">只因</text><text for="L40">有些事情早已不对劲了</text><text for="L41">我一直在意 处处留意 你却从未放在心上</text><text for="L42">你肆意挥霍 虚掷心力</text><text for="L43">把所有光阴都奉给外面的谎言</text><text for="L44">噢 噢</text><text for="L45">是啊 是啊</text><text for="L46">你宛如浸入骨髓的麻药</text><text for="L47">冻结所有知觉</text><text for="L48">耶</text><text for="L49">耶</text><text for="L50">像剧毒深植于脑海</text><text for="L51">抽空所有清醒</text><text for="L52">嘿</text><text for="L53">嘿 嘿 耶</text><text for="L54">你真像那无药可解的奴佛卡因</text><text for="L55">冷冷麻痹我的痛觉</text><text for="L56">一点点夺走痛觉</text><text for="L57">在神智深处蚀骨灼心</text><text for="L58">这剂麻药挥之不去</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="source"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Novocaine"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="GenriX"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="CORBAL"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Shiloh Dynasty"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Unfortunately Yours,"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1659746896"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="CA5KR2315360"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:10.680" end="3:01.320"><p begin="0:10.680" end="0:15.500" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:10.680" end="0:11.280">One</span> <span begin="0:12.110" end="0:12.580">more</span> <span begin="0:13.200" end="0:13.830">shot,</span> <span begin="0:14.600" end="0:15.500">'cause</span></p><p begin="0:16.129" end="0:18.700" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:16.129" end="0:16.290">I</span> <span begin="0:16.290" end="0:16.680">feel</span> <span begin="0:16.680" end="0:17.110">like</span> <span begin="0:17.110" end="0:17.490">you're</span> <span begin="0:17.490" end="0:17.720">up</span> <span begin="0:17.720" end="0:17.900">to</span> <span begin="0:17.900" end="0:18.330">some</span><span begin="0:18.330" end="0:18.700">thin'</span></p><p begin="0:18.990" end="0:21.370" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:18.990" end="0:19.360">Fuck</span> <span begin="0:19.360" end="0:19.690">that,</span> <span begin="0:19.690" end="0:20.160">you're</span> <span begin="0:20.160" end="0:20.380">up</span> <span begin="0:20.380" end="0:20.570">to</span> <span begin="0:20.570" end="0:21.010">some</span><span begin="0:21.010" end="0:21.370">thin'</span></p><p begin="0:22.500" end="0:24.110" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:22.500" end="